      "type": "text",
      "text": "dlt assets  \u2192  @dbt_assets (one Dagster asset auto-generated per dbt model)  \u2192  dbt tests as asset checks\n`dagster dev` locally   \u00b7   webserver + daemon in Docker Compose on a GCP e2-micro VM   \u00b7   daemon holds the daily schedule\nGitHub Actions builds and deploys the image; UI reached over an IAP tunnel (ingress is IAP-only)",
      "originalText": "dlt assets  \u2192  @dbt_assets (one Dagster asset auto-generated per dbt model)  \u2192  dbt tests as asset checks\n`dagster dev` locally   \u00b7   webserver + daemon in Docker Compose on a GCP e2-micro VM   \u00b7   daemon holds the daily schedule\nGitHub Actions builds and deploys the image; UI reached over an IAP tunnel (ingress is IAP-only)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
